Descriptions taken from the manual
----------------------------------

Much of the writing describing what each mode and knob does is Chase Bliss's
own, quoted or closely adapted from the Lost + Found manual rather than written
for this site. That covers the twenty-four mode descriptions, the per-mode tips
and the knob descriptions — roughly 1,400 words in all.

Copyright in that text remains with Chase Bliss Audio.

The rest — the drawing of the enclosure, the mode-picker, the printed-page
index, and the notes marked as inferred rather than documented — was written
for this site and is covered by the MIT licence.


